./ * HRC244DS - Add support for most of HNDIO from VM/ESA
./ *
./ * Update DEVTAB and User Interrupt Table references 
./ * to use the new DEVSECT DSECT. This update makes 
./ * structure or logic changes.  
./ *
./ * PREREQUISITES:
./ * none
./ *
./ * HISTORY:
./ * 29-Mar-2026 WDENTON  Initial version for VM370CE V1 R1.2
./ *
./ R 00250000 00251000 $ 00250010 1000
         USING DEVSECT,R5                                      HRC244DS 00250010
         LH    R9,DEVADDR     Set R9 to console address        HRC244DS 00251010
./ I 00599000 $ 00599100
         DEVSECT ,                                             HRC244DS 00599100